{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:35:56.106603", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Network Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### **Network Overview**\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1 to switch_8). Hosts (host_1 to host_8) are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The SDN controller operates at 20.0.0.100 and manages the switches via OpenFlow.\\n\\n#### **Reachability Analysis**\\nPing tests were conducted between hosts to assess connectivity. Below are the findings:\\n\\n1. **Successful Connectivity**:\\n   - Host-to-host communication is successful for most pairs. For example:\\n     - `host_1` to `host_8`: 0% packet loss, average RTT 41.029 ms.\\n     - `host_3` to `host_4`: 0% packet loss, average RTT 37.703 ms.\\n     - `host_5` to `host_8`: 0% packet loss, average RTT 40.491 ms.\\n   - RTT values are within acceptable ranges, indicating stable communication.\\n\\n2. **Anomalous Behavior**:\\n   - **Host_2**:\\n     - Ping tests from `host_2` to `host_8` and `host_4` failed entirely. No packets were transmitted or received, and the status is marked as \"unknown.\"\\n   - This suggests a potential issue with `host_2` or its associated edge switch (`switch_2`).\\n\\n#### **Preliminary Observations**\\n- The majority of hosts exhibit normal behavior, with consistent connectivity and low packet loss.\\n- The anomaly is isolated to `host_2`, which is unable to communicate with other hosts. This could be due to:\\n  - A misconfiguration or failure in `switch_2`.\\n  - Network interface issues on `host_2`.\\n  - Problems with the SDN controller\\'s flow rules for `switch_2`.\\n\\n#### **Next Steps**\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of the anomaly involving `host_2`. This will involve:\\n- Examining the network configuration of `host_2`.\\n- Checking the status and logs of `switch_2`.\\n- Verifying flow rules and OpenFlow communication between `switch_2` and the SDN controller.\\n\\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='87ea7ed8-0a2c-4d57-b2c0-15977efcd59b'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
